        "body_raw": "You can dismiss any pit spell (such as create pitAPG, hungry pitAPG, spiked pitAPG, and similar spells with “pit” in their names) or wall spell (such as wall of fire, wall of ice, and similar spells with “wall” in their names) you cast. The spells must have a duration of at least 1 round. This ability follows the normal rules for dismissing spells, allowing you to dismiss conjured pits and walls as a standard action."
